      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am confused by this statement, and it looks like it is out of sync with the comment.\n\nIf `this.revisionActions.aiReview` is undefined, then this returns false, which isn\u0027t what the comment says.\n\n\n\n```suggestion\n    return !(this.revisionActions?.aiReview?.enabled \u003d\u003d\u003d false);\n```",
